### `prost::Message` Methods (F1–F136)

Each of the 34 protobuf message types has four auto-generated
`prost::Message` methods. Their behaviour is determined entirely by
the wire-format encoding rules of Protocol Buffers v3:

- **`encode_raw(&self, buf: &mut impl BufMut)`** — Writes each field
  to the output buffer using the protobuf wire format (varint for
  integer fields, length-delimited for bytes/strings/nested messages).
